{"3749320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hua Manlou", "steam_appid": 3749320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《Hua Manlou》</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/b657f29b7e474842dcfbfd6584dae80a.poster.avif?t=1787291920\" width=1138 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/b657f29b7e474842dcfbfd6584dae80a.webm?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/b657f29b7e474842dcfbfd6584dae80a.mp4?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1. Core Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ling Kingdom is repeatedly invaded by the Wei Kingdom. The emperor dispatches a trusted confidant (the player) to infiltrate the Wei capital, using the Hua Manlou dance hall as a cover, to train young female spies for intelligence gathering and assassination missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/474d5b375eb675cef9ceebc31c98d114.poster.avif?t=1787291920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/474d5b375eb675cef9ceebc31c98d114.webm?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/474d5b375eb675cef9ceebc31c98d114.mp4?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2. Core Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit six beautiful young women with unique skills and train their exclusive abilities. Under the guise of managing the dance hall, complete missions while simultaneously advancing the storyline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/a1923c9c242c7d314ec9ccdf31837c9a.poster.avif?t=1787291920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/a1923c9c242c7d314ec9ccdf31837c9a.webm?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/a1923c9c242c7d314ec9ccdf31837c9a.mp4?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Character Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/23c39fe84e0b524bcd665d586343b6d3.avif?t=1787291920\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras_big/23c39fe84e0b524bcd665d586343b6d3.avif?t=1787291920 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. Unique System Settings</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Management System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various methods to increase the Hua Manlou's reputation and revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/35961ff78f9dde20e81799b57c675536.poster.avif?t=1787291920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/35961ff78f9dde20e81799b57c675536.webm?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/35961ff78f9dde20e81799b57c675536.mp4?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dating System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By arranging training programs for the girls, giving them gifts, and going on dates, enhance their skills and the emotional bond between them, strengthening the player's immersion and emotional connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/b69646df3b1eae14e9effb507b11c967.poster.avif?t=1787291920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/b69646df3b1eae14e9effb507b11c967.webm?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/b69646df3b1eae14e9effb507b11c967.mp4?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's fate and love story are closely intertwined. Players will find the ending closest to their ideal among over 40 different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/05eb41dda2a72a6be7cd2ab86962e0aa.poster.avif?t=1787291920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/05eb41dda2a72a6be7cd2ab86962e0aa.webm?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/05eb41dda2a72a6be7cd2ab86962e0aa.mp4?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >《Hua Manlou》</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><