akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/a1923c9c242c7d314ec9ccdf31837c9a.poster.avif?t=1787291920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/a1923c9c242c7d314ec9ccdf31837c9a.webm?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/a1923c9c242c7d314ec9ccdf31837c9a.mp4?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >3. Character Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/23c39fe84e0b524bcd665d586343b6d3.avif?t=1787291920\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras_big/23c39fe84e0b524bcd665d586343b6d3.avif?t=1787291920 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4. Unique System Settings</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Management System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various methods to increase the Hua Manlou's reputation and revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/35961ff78f9dde20e81799b57c675536.poster.avif?t=1787291920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/35961ff78f9dde20e81799b57c675536.webm?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/35961ff78f9dde20e81799b57c675536.mp4?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dating System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By arranging training programs for the girls, giving them gifts, and going on dates, enhance their skills and the emotional bond between them, strengthening the player's immersion and emotional connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/b69646df3b1eae14e9effb507b11c967.poster.avif?t=1787291920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/b69646df3b1eae14e9effb507b11c967.webm?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/b69646df3b1eae14e9effb507b11c967.mp4?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple Endings System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist's fate and love story are closely intertwined. Players will find the ending closest to their ideal among over 40 different endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/05eb41dda2a72a6be7cd2ab86962e0aa.poster.avif?t=1787291920\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/05eb41dda2a72a6be7cd2ab86962e0aa.webm?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749320/extras/05eb41dda2a72a6be7cd2ab86962e0aa.mp4?t=1787291920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Infiltrate the enemy capital, using the entertainment venue &quot;Hua Man Lou&quot; as a cover, and secretly train six talented and beautiful women as spies to carry out reconnaissance and assassinations. Advance the plot through skill development, and unlock three endings through love, hate, and revenge.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chin